# astrion-skill v1
goal: Show an inspiring quote
trigger:
  - phrase: "quote"
  - phrase: "inspire me"
  - phrase: "quote of the day"
  - cron: "0 8 * * *"
do: |
  Pick a quote from the built-in 200-quote bundle (rotating daily —
  use today's date as seed so the same date always shows the same
  quote). Show as a notification with the author below. Tap to open
  Notes app pre-populated with the quote text for journaling.
constraints:
  level: L1
  budget_tokens: 100
  reversibility: FREE
